nners lend to sinners, expecting to be repaid in full.","6:35":"But love your enemies, do good to them, and lend to them, expecting nothing in return. Then your reward will be great, and you will be sons of the Most High; for He is kind to the ungrateful and wicked.","6:36":"Be merciful, just as your Father is merciful."}}},"pairs":{"mt-lk":{"exact":35,"lemma":11,"pctA":24.7,"pctB":28.9,"run":5,"runText":"τὸ αὐτὸ ποιοῦσιν καὶ ἐὰν"}},"minor":[]}